| {decision} for bounded engineering conformance | Independent P06 probes and focused/regression suites | tests={all(x["passed"] for x in reports.values())}; protection={protected["passed"]}; stable={stable}; failed_observations={status["failed_observations"]} | finite synthetic cases and unannotated source availability | independent result review if PASS; repair if FAIL | professional accounting validity, empirical forecast validity, human acceptance, or wider MC01–MC35/G1–G18 closure |

